{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to RPS ARENA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPS ARENA is a fast-paced local platform-fighter where you turn into Rock, Paper, or Scissors to outwit and destroy your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to four players locally or play with bots:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUT THERE CAN ONLY BE ONE RPS MASTER!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made and tested with Xbox Controllers. Up to two players may also play on the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLLER</strong>: Left stick to move, A turn to paper/jump, X turn to scissors/speed-boost, B turn to rock/slam-down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEYBOARD 1</strong>: ARROWS to move, UP turn to paper/jump, DOWN turn to scissors/speed-boost, PERIOD turn to rock/slam-down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEYBOARD 2</strong>: WASD to move, W turn to paper/jump, S turn to scissors/speed-boost, L-SHIFT turn to rock/slam-down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Updates Coming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I intend to update this game, so please let me know if you run into any bugs or issues and I will do my best to patch them out quickly! This is a solo-project, so it helps a lot! You can email me at: <a href=\"mailto:rpsarenagame@gmail.com\">rpsarenagame@gmail.com</a>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you all for the support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you enjoy RPS ARENA!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048650?t=1774310082","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048650?t=1774310082","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048650/3e0a8b561b898780983a9220312abf87614051c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774310082","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048650/3e0a8b561b898780983a9220312abf87614051c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774310082","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to RPS ARENA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPS ARENA is a fast-paced local platform-fighter where you turn into Rock, Paper, or Scissors to outwit and destroy your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to four players locally or play with bots:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUT THERE CAN ONLY BE ONE RPS MASTER!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made and tested with Xbox Controllers. Up to two players may also play on the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLLER</strong>: Left stick to move, A turn to paper/jump, X turn to scissors/speed-boost, B turn to rock/slam-down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEYBOARD 1</strong>: ARROWS to move, UP turn to paper/jump, DOWN turn to scissors/speed-boost, PERIOD turn to rock/slam-down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEYBOARD 2</strong>: WASD to move, W turn to paper/jump, S turn to scissors/speed-boost, L-SHIFT turn to rock/slam-down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Updates Coming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I intend to update this game, so please let me know if you run into any bugs or issues and I will do my best to patch them out quickly! This is a solo-project, so it helps a lot! You can email me at: <a href=\"mailto:rpsarenagame@gmail.com\">rpsarenagame@gmail.com</a>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tha